;
; How Watchfire files one field of the medical ID in MYRA
; (watchfire_rules.h WF4): which field it is (1 name .. 6 notes), how many
; bytes the person typed (the text itself is kept exactly as typed, never
; computed or read for meaning) and when it was set (ms since 1970).
^ZXWFMED(field:i1) = bytes:i3! ^ stamp:i15!
